WEBVTT

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:19.960
The Dragon's Grace...?

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.170
You call this salvation?!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:49.750
This isn't looking good.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.250
What's with these things?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.040
Something's got 'em frenzied!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.710
Everyone fall back to Phastan!

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:08.710
Roger!

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.880
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:26.250
Seems like that rain is making monsters go berserk.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.290
This guy used the Blue Moon of Salvation's Curse Well

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:34.130
and paired it with an artificial rain machine
to spread this curse far and wide.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:35.540
What madness..

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.040
Young sage...

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.080
I once rose to face a mighty dragon
only to forfeit my life to it.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:55.330
My failure to fulfill my mission filled my soul with regret.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:03.040
Yet try as we sages may, another,
mightier dragon will always rise,

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:00.250
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.170
plunging the world into chaos.

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:10.710
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:11.830
But now I have come to bring all sages,
all the world as a whole, salvation at last.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:18.080
So that's the plan, then. Salvation through destruction
in an attempt to break the cycle.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.380
Might as well be a dragon himself
if that's what he's doing.

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:24.960
So what's my move, now?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:33.040
<b>EPISODE 12</b>

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:33.040
<b>MY ISEKAI LIFE</b>

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:42.040
Young sage, accept the salvation
I now bestow upon you.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.790
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:51.330
A barrier like this isn't going to hold!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.170
I need to fight back!

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:54.830
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.830
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:58.290
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.540
Hellfire of Decimation!

