Hellfire of Decimation!

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.460
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.540
What incredible, terrible power!

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.830
Yuji! We have trouble!

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.960
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.710
Monsters are headed for the town!

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.500
And lots of 'em!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.380
With scary eyes!

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.380
Kilia, too?

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.080
Spell Transfer - Fireball!

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:40.670
Your limited powers cannot protect this world.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:50.460
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:50.460
<b>Sense Share</b>

