<b>Sense Share</b>

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.130
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.130
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.380
Fighting off this guy and defending the towns
at the same time really isn't looking feasible.

