<b>Status Effect: Excessive Magic Use</b>

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.420
So what's my move?

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.540
Yuji!

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.000
The people of Phastan are gathering in the square!

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.750
Dryad?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:09.960
Move it!

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:10.540
All right!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.710
We're set.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.130
The monsters are at our door!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.250
Is everyone ready?

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:20.500
Yuji once defended this town for us all.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:25.500
With him gone, we must now
defend our home by our own hands!

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.710
If Yuji could do it, so can we!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.880
Let's do this, fellas!

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.880
We have plenty of potions!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.080
They're all ready for battle!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.630
They sound excited!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:44.710
Looks like they've got things covered.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:48.170
Slime, stick close to Gale and the rest.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.130
We'll provide backup magic.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.630
Roger!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.500
Yuji!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.040
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.040
<b>Sense Share</b>

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.040
Things are the same here!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.330
And here!

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:04.920
A massive wave of monsters
has been spotted in the Delight Woods.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.330
That wave is now surrounding our town!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.670
Sure sounds like trouble, huh?

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.670
Yeah, but look...

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:19.960
Adventurers have been flocking to Kilia ever since
news the Earth Dragon was slain began to spread.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:18.460
We were fortunate to suffer no loss

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:22.040
during the encounter with the Blue Dragon of Delight...

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.040
We'll keep this place safe!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:26.960
...but we must fight off the threat
at our doors by our own hands this day!

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.460
Keep your wits about you and stand strong!

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.170
Yuji, we won't let your heroic deeds go to waste.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:47.130
We survived the harshest of winters!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.130
What can some herd of monsters do to us?

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:55.920
Yuji helped us rebuild our town,
now let's show him what we're made of!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.380
Good luck, everyone!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.880
Know you'll be eating good when you get back!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.210
Move out! Time to get chopping!

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:11.130
You've got all the armor you'll ever need!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.670
Now make sure you come back in one piece to return it!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:17.960
That's the very best stuff,
all made with Lesser Fire Dragon jewels!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:23.290
These monsters are nothing
compared to that Fire Dragon!

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:25.460
They stand no chance against my wares!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.420
Everyone's up and ready!

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:30.330
This is amazing!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.000
Now I get it...

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:37.290
I always worked alone, never asking for help.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.540
At some point that became my new normal...

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:58.670
But maybe teamwork isn't so bad.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:10.710
Spell Transfer - Attack Boost!
Anti-Magic Boost! Defense Boost!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.750
What's going on?!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.170
I feel light as a feather!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.210
Feeling in the zone, today!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:35.630
Don't know why, but I feel ENERGIZED!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:47.330
All right, the towns can defend themselves, now.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.040
Now all that's left...

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.580
...is to do something about him.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.630
The almighty appears enraged.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:58.920
Father Steyl?

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.460
I was bestowed with a new revelation from above.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:10.290
"When sun and moon align as one star in the sky,
then shall be delivered divine judgment."

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.710
The sun and moon...?

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.630
We'll just have to go for it.

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.540
Let's do this, slimes!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.750
Yuji, you sure you're all right?

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.080
Can you keep this up?

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.790
Don't worry.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.750
I still have Dryad's mana restorative.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.380
With this I can...

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:35.080
"...bring your magic power
back to what it was ten minutes prior!"

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:38.330
Pretty sure I was still in good shape 10 minutes ago.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Status</b>

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Yuji</b>

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Class: Tamer, Sage</b>

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Skills: Taming, Sense Share, Holy Magic, Dark Magic, Fire Magic, Water Magic, Ice Magic,</b>

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Earth Magic, Lightning Magic, Wind Magic, Support Magic, Buff Magic, Spell Transfer,</b>

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Master-class Combat Skills, Magic Maker</b>

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.330
<b>Type: None</b>

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.540
You really work wonders, Dryad.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:50.960
Yay!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.330
Proud Wolf! You take care of Father Steyl!

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:56.540
You got it!

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.630
Jump Boost!

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.750
Anti-Physical Barrier!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:02.790
Jump Boost!

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:03.920
Anti-Physical Barrier!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:04.830
Jump Boost!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.330
You dare defy the path to salvation?

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:15.210
Why do you defend this world so, young sage?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:17.920
I didn't exactly volunteer for this.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.380
Who knows?

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:27.540
I see. A sage needs no reason
to defend the world, does he?

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.040
Perhaps I once felt much the same.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.040
That's not exactly it...

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.880
I just think this world is fine the way it is.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.750
So be it, then.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:11.630
Let us sages fight without reason,
and bring this to an end once and for all.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.830
Hellfire of Demise - times three!

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.540
Salvation will soon befall this world.

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:25.580
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.830
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.380
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.880
Hellfire of Decimation!

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:35.880
Use all the magic you wish.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:39.630
Until your mortal flesh can take no more.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.250
He's right. He's just whittling me down.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.040
<b>Divine Strike</b>

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.040
<b>Available in</b>

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:47.040
<b>seconds</b>

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.040
This is the skill I used on the Blue Dragon of Delight...

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.580
Is this what "judgment" meant?

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.130
Divine Strike!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.500
<b>Divine Strike</b>

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.500
<b>Available in</b>

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.500
<b>seconds</b>

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.500
Does this mean I can use it again...?

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.330
Divine Strike!

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:16.500
It worked.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.170
Divine Strike!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:19.500
Divine Strike!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.130
Divine Strike!

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:22.670
Divine Strike!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:23.790
Divine Strike!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.210
He calls down divine judgment, again and again!

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.960
A direct hit won't do, huh?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:40.380
If that's the case, let's try something else.

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:42.500
Slimes!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:45.830
Curse you!

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:49.670
Prepare to face my wrath!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:51.670
You got it!

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:52.580
On my way!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:53.750
On it!

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:54.750
Let's do it!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.130
Onward!

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.210
We got this!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.080
We'll get 'em!

00:11:58.080 --> 00:11:59.630
Here goes!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.880
I'm counting on you slimes!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:03.630
<b>Divine Strike</b>

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:03.630
<b>Available in</b>

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:03.630
<b>seconds</b>

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:04.250
Divine Strike!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.830
I ain't ever seen anything so bright!

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:18.710
"When sun and moon align as one star in the sky..."

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:24.540
Begone, along with this whole world!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.290
Now!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:33.830
Spell Transfer - Magic Barrier - times six!

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:42.580
Total... Isolation Array!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.830
How can this be?

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:53.080
That legendary monster armor did the trick.
This barrier is solid.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.540
You dare enclose me inside your barrier?!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.670
You and your magic, too.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.540
How dare you!

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:09.830
And now you're...

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.170
Yuji!

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:54.580
Yuji!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.540
Yuji!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:56.580
Yuji!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.830
Yuji!

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.880
I threw a barrier on myself just to be safe...

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.170
But that was too close for comfort...

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:18.580
Oh, great divine, the world has been saved.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:27.330
"Chaos shall rise, the masses
led astray by a tainted light."

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:31.960
"Guide the emissary, and grace shall be yours again."

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:38.040
"Then, by the death of you who offers guidance,
shall the sage arise."

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.330
And so it was....

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:52.380
It was Walter who offered guidance,
and the sage which arose from his death...

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.830
May we some day meet again.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.130
Why are you always so quick to leave?

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.500
I wanted to feast!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:16.380
Say, Yuji, why didn't we hang around in Ordarion?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.750
The Blue Moon of Salvation still runs the guild there.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.540
I'd rather not let them get suspicious.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.580
Fair enough.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:32.580
Oh, right.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.290
Slimes, how are things in the towns?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:40.210
They're celebrating over here!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.960
Sure looks like fun!

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:46.540
All right! Victory is ours!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.920
We did well fighting them off.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.170
Because we all worked as one!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:52.880
Thank you all!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.500
Hurrah!

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.880
Goes to show what we're made of!

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:04.580
I felt this surge of power once we took to battle!

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.540
You all fought bravely!

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.380
Our town knows peace once more!

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:14.250
Go on and eat up!

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.540
There's enough for seconds and thirds!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.790
Spring is upon us once more!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.830
Our armor is the best there is!

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:29.790
The best the world has ever seen!

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.420
Yay!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.960
Yippee!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:39.000
Everyone's so happy!

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.830
Great news, ain't it?

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:42.790
Yeah.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.880
Today's a good day, huh?

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:46.750
Sure is.

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:58.040
News is we've lost contact with Walter.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:00.000
How could that be?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.630
Do you think that explosion earlier today was...?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:09.540
No way to know. But word is the summoning ceremony
went south and him and all his men were lost.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.210
We should inform headquarters.

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:12.540
No.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:17.080
There's no need to trouble them with such trivial matters.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:22.960
As it stands, time has all but run out for this continent.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:27.080
The Purifier is nearly complete.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.130
Once operational, the entire continent
will be wiped clean.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:34.130
None will survive.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.630
I suppose that's true.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:40.080
So the time has come? It's been a long wait.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.670
Our lives now approach their end.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.750
But we all serve a higher purpose
through the Blue Moon of Salvation.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.290
We do this to defeat the Black Dragon of Ruin.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:54.460
Only the faithful can defeat such a beast,
and it will be our hands which do.

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.880
Such a time will soon be upon us.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:03.210
Let us pray together, to cleanse this tainted world.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:06.830
"Cleanse this tainted world!"

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.460
A "Purifier" and the Black Dragon of Ruin, huh?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.880
These folks never stop causing trouble.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:20.000
Yuji.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.420
We've got a monster.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.210
That thing looks tough!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.420
And there are more!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.710
P-present here as well!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.830
There we are.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.250
Excuse me.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.250
Yes?

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:00.710
I'd like to take this request.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.580
I happened to stumble on them,
so I took them down already.

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:07.790
Oh, my! A Cannibal Tigre?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:15.330
Your whole party will get credited for this task,
so please be sure to bring the others by.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:19.580
What party? I always work alone.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.630
Alone...?

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:33.460
I'm sorry to have spoken so heartlessly...

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:42.540
The loss of your fellow party members
must have been so traumatic

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:46.460
you've convinced yourself they never existed...

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:48.830
Uh...

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:55.250
Don't let this burden you.
Cannibal Tigres are powerful monsters!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:20:01.130
I am certain your fellow party members
rest in peace knowing you survived.

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:04.250
No, but...

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.130
Is something the matter?

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:09.040
Oh, Meggia!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:14.210
This man defeated the Cannibal Tigre.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:22.080
Hmm... And without the use of a single blade.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:25.500
This beast was felled with fire magic, I imagine.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.250
And not by many hands, either.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:29.460
Huh?

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:32.750
Do you happen to be a magic adept?

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.500
No, I'm just a tamer.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:36.880
I see...

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:41.750
I've heard tales of a magic-wielding tamer.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:45.960
You don't mean...

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:50.040
The man who saved countless villages
from monster attacks?

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:53.000
The one who fought off legendary dragons?

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:55.670
The tamer named Yuji?!

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.500
Well...

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.040
...what am I supposed to do now?

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:09.170
Maa ikkatte ukenagashite
Brushing things off with a "whatever"<b></b>

00:21:09.170 --> 00:21:12.380
Nochi no jinsei wa henka shinakute
Stuck later in an unchanging life<b></b>

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:14.540
Mou ikka wa joushuu no te de
The whatevers became habit<b></b>

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.710
Boku no nouryoku wa imada sakanai
My skills still have yet to bloom<b></b>

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:22.960
Katou tomosezu makeru koto mo itowanai nara
If I don't try to win and am willing to lose<b></b>

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:28.290
Mukishitsu na shinjou wa naze toki o utsu
Why does this cold heart still beat with time?<b></b>

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:34.750
Bokura dare mo ga himetaru chikara o motta monster
All of us are monsters with hidden powers<b></b>

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:40.500
Da toshite mezame saseru koto naku ikitekuno
Are we going to live without awakening them?<b></b>

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.670
Oshikonde futa shite
We push things down and cover them up<b></b>

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:46.380
Mou shinsen na kokoro janai
And our hearts are fresh no more<b></b>

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:51.330
Sore demo kaoiro hitotsu kaezu ni ikiru monster
But we're monsters who continue on without so much as a face<b></b>

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:57.710
Dare mo ga mujikaku no sokojikara o uchi ni shinobaseru
All of us have undiscovered powers hidden inside<b></b>

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:01.670
Tsugi wa kimi no ban da
You're up next<b></b>

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:07.500
Tachimukaeyo monster
Stand and face it monster<b></b>

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:13.790
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!
Time to eat! Da da da dan!<b></b>

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.830
Tansaku mo choutatsu mo ote no mono
Exploration and procurement are our specialties<b></b>

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:18.380
"Tomodachi takusan tsukretekita yo!"
"Be sure to bring lots of friends!"<b></b>

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:22.130
Machi made ato ippo no toko de encount
There's always an encounter one step away from town<b></b>

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:23.290
"Haa kufuku de! Chikara ga nee!"
"Agh, I'm starved! My strength is gone!"<b></b>

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:24.750
"Kibichii mamono ga jiirojiro!"
"Look at all these tough baddies!"<b></b>

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:26.210
"Maji panee! Maji panee!"
"This is ridic! Seriously ridic!"<b></b>

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:30.330
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"
"Crazy, wild, and super glaring!"<b></b>

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.420
"Fumu, koko wa okunote shika nai desuzo...!"
"Well it seems time we use our secret weapon!" <b></b>

00:22:28.420 --> 00:22:30.040
"Sonnano attakke?"
"Since when do we have one?"<b></b>

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:32.330
"Niigerun da yo!"
"I say we ruuun!"<b></b>

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:35.580
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta
But we wound up surrounded<b></b>

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:41.000
Zenmetsu suru to wa nani goto ka!
We're about to experience annihilation!<b></b>

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:48.880
Yuushatachi yo tachiagare!
Brave heroes stand and fight!<b></b>

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:50.290
"Karyoku infure zoukyouyaku"
"Firepower boosting potions"<b></b>

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:51.460
"Kameba kamu hodo chou kaifuku"
"The more you chew, the more you get super healed"<b></b>

00:22:51.460 --> 00:22:54.380
Tsuyomi ga tsuyomi ga deruzo
Strength strength coursing through us<b></b>

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:57.380
Happadayo!
Here's some leaves!<b></b>

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:57.380
"Itadaitokimashou!"
"Let's take them!"<b></b>

00:22:57.380 --> 00:22:59.710
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!
Time to eat! Da da da dan!<b></b>

00:23:01.210 --> 00:23:06.290
Youyaku aritsuketa gohan ga oishii ne!
This food we finally got our hands on is great, huh?<b></b>

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:09.170
Doukutsu demo mayoi no mori demo
Whether in caves or in the lost woods,<b></b>

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:11.920
Aa manpuku manzoku shizen no baikingu
Oh we eat our fill from nature's buffet<b></b>

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.000
Onaka ga suite wa ikusa ga dekinai ne!
Can't fight on an empty stomach!<b></b>

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:22.170
Ikuzo gattai kougekida! Tobikiri magical tsuyoi yatsu
Let's go, give it a fusion attack! A super strong magical one<b></b>

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:25.460
Chi o saki hi wo fuke!
Split the earth and breathe fire!<b></b>

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:26.670
"Hyakuninriki no kyuukyoku mahou da!"
"Ultimate super-powered magic!"<b></b>

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.040
"Maryoku to cheat no housekibako da!"
"A jewelry box of magical power and cheats!"<b></b>

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:29.460
"Shuuen no gouka de ichimoudajin da!"
"Hellfire of Demise will get them all in one go!"<b></b>

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:32.250
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"
"That was all in your dreams, right?"<b></b>

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:34.880
CHEST!
A CHEST!<b></b>

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:37.380
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!
Yuji! Yuji! The best! The Sage! Yuji! Yuji! Oooh tame me!<b></b>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:39.710
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!
Time to eat! Da da da dan!<b></b>
